-- KELMAT EL TAGHYEER MEN LOGHA TANYA -------------------- main.franco.kl  K0912

`let mut` w `const` men loghat tanya. F Kalam `khali` bet3arraf esm mayetghayarsh, w `motghayer` bet3arraf esm yenfa3 yetghayar.

8│     const xs = [1, 2, 3]
       ^^^^^

Garrab: `khali`

Mosa3da: Ekteb `motghayer x` badal `let mut x`, w `khali x` badal `const x`. `kalam fix` bey3mel keda lak.

E3raf aktar: kalam explain K0912
